  "body": "Automated bridge job `RQ-PHX-RECLAIMORIGINAL865S` (pool: codex-cmp), single commit on base `8a2dd8c65`.\n\n**Tests:** no test command\n\n<details><summary>Agent notes</summary>\n\n# RQ-PHX-RECLAIMORIGINAL865S\n\nRecovered the historical memory-reclaim inventory and rationale from PR #5803\nhead e6a6ec04cc2ef14607fdde1819ee417f2c9702cb. The document distinguishes the\nabsent reclaim entry point from the supported read-only fleet memory view.\nRuntime changes and other documentation slices from #5803 remain unrecovered;\nthis is not full preservation or closure of the PR.\n\nCommands and results:\n- `entire resume codex-bridge/RQ-PHX-RECLAIMORIGINAL865S`: no checkpoint.\n- `phm docs --agent --json`: passed; `phm mcp list --json` and `phm wire status --json`: exit 1 (no output captured). No global install attempted.\n- `git fetch origin pull/5803/head`: passed, head matched the SHA above.\n- `HOME=$(mktemp -d) npm run test:ci -- test/mem-reclaim-original-865s.test.ts`: passed, 1 file / 2 tests.\n- `npx --no-install eslint test/mem-reclaim-original-865s.test.ts`: failed before analysis; installed ESLint lacks `../lib/cli`.\n- `git fetch origin master`: passed, origin/master at 1fe354b73b336b1b5381e171b4f26257fd072058; inspected CLI paths unchanged from checkout, reclaim files absent.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json`: passed (tsgo unavailable).\n\nImplementation and test: 73 added lines, 0 removed. No commits or external publication.\ntoolsUsed: []\n</details>\n",
